%9Setting:%9

    backup_keep (integer; default: 7)

%9Description:%9

    How many automatic backups of this erssi home stay in backup_dir.
    After each backup that worked, the newest backup_keep files named
    erssi-auto-ID-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS.tar.gz, ID the one of this home
    (/HELP backup), are kept and older ones of that name removed. Files
    of any other name are never removed, nor links, nor the backups of
    another home: put a backup you want to keep under another name. 0
    keeps them all.

%9Examples:%9

    /SET backup_keep 7
    /SET backup_keep 0

%9See also:%9 BACKUP, BACKUP_AUTO, BACKUP_DIR
